THE macOS APPLICATION BUNDLE
============================

The macOS bundle is self-contained, so it redistributes all of the below and
carries the full text of every one of their licenses in
Musix.app/Contents/Resources/licenses. It runs on macOS 14 and later; every
binary in it is built for that, and the build refuses to ship otherwise.

